# --- test/runtime temp artifacts -------------------------------------------
# This sandbox denies writes to %TEMP%, so tempfile.gettempdir() falls back to
# the current working directory and pytest/Playwright leave their scratch dirs
# in the repo root. Ignore them so they never reach a commit.
/tmp[a-z0-9_]*/
/inline-snapshot-*/
/.tmp/
.tmp-*/